sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Controller
    participant Appointment Model
    participant Event
    participant AppServiceProvider
    participant SmsService
    participant SmsApiGateway
    participant SMSAPI.pl
    participant Database

    User->>Controller: Create Appointment
    Controller->>Appointment Model: Appointment::create()
    Appointment Model->>Database: INSERT appointment
    Appointment Model->>Event: dispatch AppointmentCreated

    Event->>AppServiceProvider: Event Listener triggered

    AppServiceProvider->>AppServiceProvider: Check SMS enabled (settings)
    AppServiceProvider->>AppServiceProvider: Check send_booking_confirmation

    alt SMS Enabled
        AppServiceProvider->>SmsService: sendFromTemplate('appointment-created')

        SmsService->>SmsService: Check suppression list
        SmsService->>SmsService: Check GDPR consent
        SmsService->>SmsService: Check spending limits
        SmsService->>Database: Fetch SmsTemplate
        SmsService->>SmsService: Render template with Blade
        SmsService->>Database: Create SmsSend (status=pending)

        SmsService->>SmsApiGateway: send(phone, message)
        SmsApiGateway->>SMSAPI.pl: HTTP POST /sms.do
        SMSAPI.pl-->>SmsApiGateway: Response {sms_id, status}
        SmsApiGateway-->>SmsService: Success

        SmsService->>Database: Update SmsSend (status=sent, sms_id)
        SmsService->>Database: Create SmsEvent (type=sent)
        SmsService-->>AppServiceProvider: SMS sent OK
    else SMS Disabled
        AppServiceProvider->>AppServiceProvider: Skip SMS, log info
    end

    AppServiceProvider-->>Controller: Continue flow
    Controller-->>User: Appointment created response
